      "chunk_id": "fc1c9d3f-b4e9-49ff-89cb-6d3e7bd1e29a",
      "content": "Prohibited Behavior\n\nEmployees must not attempt to bypass security controls, scan systems without approval, copy customer data to personal storage, or use company systems for illegal, harassing, or discriminatory activity.",
