      "chunk_id": "a3b6b2f3-1997-4c5d-a9de-2c0f6db5b950",
      "content": "Storage Rules\n\nInternal, Confidential, and Restricted data must be stored in approved company systems. Restricted data must not be downloaded to personal devices. Confidential data should not be stored in local folders unless there is a documented business need.",
